<body class="bg-[#0b2c4d] text-[#d6ecff] font-mono min-h-screen flex flex-col text-sm lg:text-lg">
    {% include "components/navbar.html.jinja" %}
  <main class="flex-grow">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <div class="py-[90px] px-[80px] bg-[#0e3a63] border-b-2 border-dashed border-[#6fb7ff]">

    <h1 class="text-[44px] mb-[20px] tracking-[1px]">About BluePrint</h1>

    <p class="max-w-[700px] text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
            BluePrint gives you clear, step-by-step repair guides powered by
            artificial intelligence — helping you save money and reduce electronic waste.
    </p>
    
<!-- THE PEOPLE -->
    <div class="py-[70px] px-[80px] bg-[#0b2c4d]">

<section class="mt-1">
  <h2 class="text-3xl mb-8 border-b-2 border-dashed border-[#6fb7ff] inline-block pb-1">
    The Team
  </h2>

  <div class="flex gap-12">
    <p class="max-w-[700px] text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed">
      BluePrint is a capstone project developed by a team of three dedicated students: Jason Geban, Caleb Ogboe, and Jayson Ramirez. 
      Each member contributes a distinct set of skills and perspectives, working collaboratively to design and build an innovative 
      AI-powered repair guide system.
      <br><br>
      The team participates in the Brooklyn STEAM Center during the morning, where they focus on technical and project-based learning, 
      and attend their respective home schools in the afternoon. Jason Geban and Caleb Ogboe attend Bedford Academy High School, 
      while Jayson Ramirez attends The High School for Global Citizenship. 
      Jason and Jayson are both seniors, while Caleb is a junior. 
      
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Team grid -->
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-6 lg:gap-[50px] mt-6 lg:mt-10">

  <!-- Jason -->
  <div class="w-full lg:w-[300px] bg-[#1a3a5a] p-5 rounded-lg 
              transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out
